# obs_source_update: the settings are merged into the source's settings; for VIDEO sources the plug-in update
# callback is deferred to the next video tick (counted in defer_update_count); other sources update at once.
# The "update" signals fire only when the callback ran.  reset_settings clears first.  Default values from
# get_defaults are visible through get_setting.
kind vid input video update,defaults
kind aud input audio update,defaults
create v vid V
create a aud A
watch v
watch a
get_setting v dflt
update v x 1
deferred v
get_setting v x
tick v 0.01
deferred v
update v x 2
update v x 3
deferred v
tick v 0.01
deferred v
update a x 1
deferred a
get_setting a x
reset_settings a
get_setting a x
get_setting a dflt
update_props a
